  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "引导2到主界面"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "speakerId": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "This is the last one!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "Ugh!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "speakerId": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "Target eliminated. The enemy squad is retreating!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "speakerId": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "Dr. {@nickname}'s commands were perfect, just like Amiya said. How reassuring!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "See, that wasn't too bad, right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Doctor, compared to everything you've been through, this is a walk in the park."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "*cough*...Why are you here... You're not from Ursus..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "We won't... let you get in the way of our duties!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "Don't even think about it!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "speakerId": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "Instructor!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "What are you spacing out for? You almost got yourself killed!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "speakerId": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "I'm... I'm sorry!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "Quick! Get back into formation!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "speakerId": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "Yessir!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Dobermann! You made it!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "It's an emergency. My team was attacked by Reunion as well."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "I rushed over to join you as soon as I could."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Why would Reunion attack us...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "An organization made up of the Infected... I've always thought they were a bit extreme..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "...and now they've resorted to violence, and in an Ursus city no less? That's a death wish."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "The situation is only going to get more chaotic from here on out."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "Amiya, we need to leave Chernobog right now."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Okay. We've already rescued the Doctor, so we can retreat according to plan."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "...And this is Dr. {@nickname}?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Yes."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "Dr. {@nickname}, you probably don't know who I am, but you know Amiya. For your safety..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "No, no..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Um, Dobermann, Doctor isn't doing very well right now."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "To put it simply, Doctor... has amnesia."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "Amnesia?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "...What are you going to do now? Weren't you planning to transfer leadership to—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Doctor still has the capacity to command."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "...At least, I've confirmed that from the previous battle."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "I can't bring myself to trust a stranger so easily."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "But I trust you, Amiya."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "...I understand."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "Dr. {@nickname}, I am Dobermann, captain of Op Team E1."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "We are going to escort you from Chernobog, which is the Ursus city we're currently in, back to Rhodes Island."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "We're in an abandoned facility in Chernobog and should now head west."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "But... since we're cut off from Dr. Kal'tsit, Dobermann and I have lead our separate teams westward to a rendezvous point before confirming our signal to retreat."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "That is, assuming everything goes according to plan."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "It'd be nice if things went that smoothly."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Today is our last opportunity to get you out of here, Dr. {@nickname}."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "But... I have a bad feeling about this."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Medic",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "A-Amiya!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "What's the matter?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Medic",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "It's... it's a call from Rhodes Island!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Are our communications back on? Is it Dr. Kal'tsit...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Sorry, but not quite."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "PRTS...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "PRTS",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "The Emergency Neural Connection Request System was activated."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "PRTS",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Interference has also been detected from Rhodes Island's end, and only partial Neural Network connection is possible."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "PRTS",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Currently unable to establish communication with Kal'tsit, who has yet to return to Rhodes Island."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "PRTS",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Your safety is confirmed; therefore, my mission is now complete."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "This piece of..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "Do we really have time for this...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "PRTS",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "If you do not need to connect to Rhodes Island, communication will be severed momentarily."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "PRTS",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "I am sincerely sorry for having interrupted your party."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Wait, wait! Don't hang up, I need your help still."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Dobermann, Doctor still needs some assistance."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "I know, but make it quick."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Doctor, PRTS is also one of our... partners. It will show you what to do next."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Time is of the essence, so I'm going to reconnect you to the Rhodes Island backup system."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "This way, we'll have an edge in battle."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "It's different from giving verbal commands and might be a bit hard to get used to, but once you learn how to use it, the entire operation will be much smoother."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "...Please trust me. Just like how you used to."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "PRTS... Let's start."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "PRTS",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Identity verification required. Select verification method."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Ah, Doctor... Please say something."
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "(Speak)",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "PRTS",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "I am not sure why you did not speak, but the action of touching the interface is sufficient—"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "PRTS",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "—Fingerprint match found. Verification complete. Security clearance: 8"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "PRTS",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Welcome home, Dr. {@nickname}."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
